# Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD)

## Database Schema & Relationships

```mermaid
erDiagram
    USERS ||--o{ BLOOD_REQUESTS : "posts (as Patient)"
    USERS ||--o{ DONATIONS : "volunteers (as Donor)"
    BLOOD_REQUESTS ||--o{ DONATIONS : "fulfilled by"

    USERS {
        int id PK
        string full_name
        string email UK
        string password
        string role "admin | donor | patient"
        string phone
        string blood_group
        string gender
        string address
        boolean is_available
        datetime created_at
    }

    BLOOD_REQUESTS {
        int id PK
        int patient_id FK
        string patient_name
        string contact_number
        string blood_group
        string hospital
        int quantity
        string urgency "Normal | Urgent | Critical"
        string status "Pending | Approved | Assigned | Completed | Cancelled"
        datetime created_at
    }

    DONATIONS {
        int id PK
        int donor_id FK
        int request_id FK
        datetime donation_date
        string status "Pending | Completed | Cancelled"
    }
```
